#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:5
#: 45676dbcdac248269d1d3074c8709cfe 4f69612d06c84aaf8a08a57b8e13aad8
#: 5de3706a19e9450b8242e058ed4c4aba 7aacdec4e69b4187a05e31a8fb6b02c4
msgid "LightWare GRF250 / GRF500"
msgstr "LightWare GRF250 / GRF500"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:7
#: 0a12cd8154824c508cbb0e8947ef4fc5 27d9bfe6c0ae462db89bd3f3e661f7f6
#: 2d8b4a856cf34ba0946f7681d55631b2 892bd8715a3b41f895b452222309ed61
msgid ""
"The `LightWare GRF250 <https://lightwarelidar.com/shop/grf-250/>`__ and "
"`GRF500 <https://lightwarelidar.com/shop/grf-500/>`__ are long-range lidar-"
"based rangefinders. Both models support serial (UART) communication and "
"provide accurate distance and signal-strength data at configurable update "
"rates."
msgstr ""
"`LightWare GRF250 <https://lightwarelidar.com/shop/grf-250/>`__ 和 `GRF500 "
"<https://lightwarelidar.com/shop/grf-500/>`__ "
"是基于激光雷达的远距离测距仪。两款型号均支持串口（UART）通信，可在可配置的更新速率下提供精确的距离和信号强度数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:10
#: 369fd7b245cd42c1b48388967eca495e c9b6afc27b594b3db79cf0064fd0f364
#: da79ff7a64e84e57953dcee56b9923ab fb3959b7895b4c0b8f606b8ba759ddba
msgid "GRF250: 0.2 m – 250 m range"
msgstr "GRF250：量程 0.2 m – 250 m"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:11
#: 34e5ef7b6e0d48c38d0f9554fc962162 4e48509cb045473b89538ea602d5a7b5
#: 6a915f881dce4dec82ebea3340594664 d5dd2ca947f4445eb120dff0c046bf2d
msgid "GRF500: 0.2 m – 500 m range"
msgstr "GRF500：量程 0.2 m – 500 m"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:18
#: 05a5532a52f042edbcc151f8930294f5 067666dad4044c4f94c6a1b9a2b0f181
#: 53585924852445b3b11f9a0dc5d6ad54 825a171689cd4b808d31a17e7fc14520
msgid ""
"Support for the LightWare GRF250 and GRF500 sensors was added in ArduPilot "
"4.7 and later."
msgstr "ArduPilot 4.7 及之后的版本加入了对 LightWare GRF250 和 GRF500 传感器的支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:21
#: 424629b753224573a2703cf5fcaa09b8 810af7f3e0fb47e39ad47138d6b80bbd
#: bcc7455668274537a98f646e436c70bf d648f44cb89f4c988d329a97043b4564
msgid "Serial Connection"
msgstr "串口连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:23
#: 081711ce08534e98a6f1deda3ec19401 25f5468a8087498abaf86ff2f88b892f
#: 3b1832596786475eb86c64374f02cd02 801567fe533c4fb99abd8acdfe21ee51
msgid ""
"The GRF sensors communicate via UART using 3.3 V or 5 V logic levels. "
"Connect the TX of the Lidar to the RX of the autopilot UART port, and the RX"
" of the Lidar to the TX of the same port. Also connect GND and 5 V to power "
"the sensor."
msgstr ""
"GRF 传感器通过 UART 通信，使用 3.3 V 或 5 V 逻辑电平。将激光雷达的 TX 接到飞控 UART 端口的 RX，将激光雷达的 RX "
"接到同一端口的 TX，并连接 GND 和 5 V 为传感器供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:31
#: 5955705553d04a2ebd03e1e18c9418ec 6ee931871f364db39f672ea80a3a38be
#: 7d440ed699964ecbada932130949500c f0af4b5ef9414337a7c6cf818a7a3052
msgid "Example (SERIAL4):"
msgstr "示例（SERIAL4）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:33
#: 0ac97a13d9c44bb1af387c935d54385c 1d41e805782d48b9b867dcce8b63044b
#: 21cf3f3843884260b5a92b445d8eba90 6875d9e29cf24c12bffb8f3d36c96fd6
msgid ""
"If the GRF is connected to the autopilots' SERIAL4 port and it is the first "
"rangefinder:"
msgstr "如果 GRF 连接在飞控的 SERIAL4 端口且是第一个测距仪："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:35
#: 9d5f3cb048174296a979d0f3c7f2021c cbf79db002de4307add8f23b122741ef
#: d231fea600294c83b712294eedc7c853 f8b40a13c43b4003ba94fcf0fc162a49
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9（激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:36
#: 235bfe003ba6447580a8dc4988729ba7 30b9a630ff8540bebc90318f29c04eb6
#: 76b6ecbdef0449f2984e7fd763049f40 e091f72039974b1394b2aa99b4358fb5
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 115 (115200 baud)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 115（115200 波特）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:37
#: 0540a207170042dfb862c62c41ad0af7 1a81ffad76d941698d565514e1d5e78b
#: 5af3cef6ac9e4025ba058c1ac89eba27 7f0e772f667f43789ea9a215a156ccf9
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 45 (LightWareGRF)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 45（LightWareGRF）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:38
#: 490f4ef6a2634d3fb45d9c39ee7455a9 517b97fb3cdc4a4fb8830af7511dfc44
#: 85d448cf3a854575b498cde6916cf512 ee02888c233a4f2eafe53882b854105d
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:39
#: 1a3032e20199491eb030cca9f716ebbc 1cc34a55364343978bbca53910ecc591
#: 240e414a67bd440dade3da51af40344f d298e801f09049e1a29218d9ad308051
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.2"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:40
#: 2adb424addfd4a05bcd343fbe024f126 6b4549bb8fb44f7f8f3385927d74d5ed
#: 98525fad4fc6412a9ad242a8876d7760 c10eb81b9d2e45ffada8c707653c725c
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 250 *(for GRF250)* or 500 *(for GRF500)*"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 250 *(GRF250)* 或 500 *(GRF500)*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:42
#: 1a3c51574d5c433a8403fb9864a04455 5acc9090fcca49409e99afe8d8d8f33a
#: b35c8b24c6ba4dba993cf285f2a613fc b5fd1a8decd242568919cd3339a656fd
msgid ""
"If instead you are using the SERIAL2 port, set :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL "
"<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9 and :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115."
msgstr ""
"如果改用 SERIAL2 端口，则设置 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 9 且 "
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 115。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:44
#: 2a2f8b9e417e45a2ad0aae87b36683d5 85d85a0358e845a5b0a64e96edfc083e
#: 861f5cd24db7403b87a6f5c326cb6a08 f12f54972cf64c77ab2b16400601de97
msgid ""
"Power note: The GRF sensors can draw higher current than typical serial "
"peripherals. Check your flight controller’s 5 V peripheral rail limits — an "
"external 5 V supply may be required."
msgstr "供电说明：GRF 传感器的电流消耗可能高于一般串口外设。请核对你的飞控 5 V 外设电源轨的限值——可能需要外接 5 V 电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:49
#: 235b136e8eb543a2af8d4c1a770c43df 348e6ceb48e34d34b9547f4fac5932e6
#: 360b2783fa50481abadfa02bafa7ba81 3e42e7cee8894020b2f8ad925dd5be99
msgid "Additional GRF-specific Parameters"
msgstr "GRF 专用附加参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:51
#: 21dc2cde0b3d4d349dabde6a6d1430d9 74edc586e48d43dca1c181c629342aa1
#: 9d26c574f1b04ce6a53237548f1a1a0e f6eaf5d2d13b47afa1159b1b1ab94ccd
msgid ""
"When :ref:`RNGFNDx_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` is set to 45 (LightWareGRF), the "
"Serial port protocol is set to 9, and the autopilot is rebooted, the "
"following additional parameters become available:"
msgstr ""
"当 :ref:`RNGFNDx_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` 设为 45（LightWareGRF）、串口协议设为 9 "
"并重启飞控后，会出现以下附加参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:53
#: 184149411d5547749c58dbb20283f2c7 70165f380f364be2a9f3137434f12505
#: a257197c9d584912b0ebd825484c5857 b9c5e6756e774fa9adae0689ca21cf95
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFNDx_GRF_RET <RNGFND1_GRF_RET>`: Selects which return type to use "
"(0: FirstRaw, 1: FirstFiltered, 2: LastRaw, 3: LastFiltered)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFNDx_GRF_RET "
"<RNGFND1_GRF_RET>`：选择使用哪种回波类型（0：FirstRaw，1：FirstFiltered，2：LastRaw，3：LastFiltered）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:54
#: 19dfd32b735843d7bcad7e297922ac2c 5e5a7681df6b4f25b749f7bac1580fd5
#: ba82235746c744779209c089335a8691 d963786a97774eb18b5b28f85d4209dc
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFNDx_GRF_ST <RNGFND1_GRF_ST>`: Sets the minimum acceptable return "
"signal strength in dB. Returns weaker than this value are ignored (0 "
"disables filtering)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFNDx_GRF_ST <RNGFND1_GRF_ST>`：设置可接受的最小回波信号强度（dB）。弱于该值的回波将被忽略（0 "
"表示禁用过滤）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:55
#: 66fbc38637db44c98e59a3a0d0025665 8f45f27809f84526b8a375f00df7f002
#: a3827f5eb01043a48cedc0b08eadbb33 e2a91355cb9646aca38fc9939e8c58f7
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFNDx_GRF_RATE <RNGFND1_GRF_RATE>`: Sets the sensor update rate in "
"Hz. GRF250 supports 1–50 readings per second, while GRF500 supports 0.5–10 "
"readings per second."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFNDx_GRF_RATE <RNGFND1_GRF_RATE>`：设置传感器更新速率（Hz）。GRF250 支持每秒 1–50 "
"次读数，GRF500 支持每秒 0.5–10 次读数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:58
#: 377715e9b119425f944ce8d180d02c50 95acb24bab254533b814b7c9e14f2d4f
#: d782c0ee0a4c42e5bd7f02bccd464b97 e59c21b64ac347aebaa0c9a5f24ad70c
msgid "Testing the Sensor"
msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:60
#: 0c19428ed2074aa2b1890b49f471c38c 0eca8a865c7648c7a3e9a5c221c1af85
#: 80a91ff1b0c14110bb3944c3102ffa8e d03c77770a65440192d8f333f0fe43af
msgid ""
"You can view the live distance readings in Mission Planner → Flight Data → "
"Status tab, under the field named “rangefinder1” (or `rangefinder2` / 3 for "
"additional sensors)."
msgstr ""
"可以在 Mission Planner → Flight Data → Status 选项卡中名为 “rangefinder1” "
"的字段查看实时距离读数（更多传感器则为 `rangefinder2` / 3）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-grf250-lidar.rst:65
#: 3d9012dc7c5a4dd990cc1f9a433834f0 432387341c7f46a89f2b5c717b91bf0d
#: bf2c66ac79da4140b80e25bf31782971 c36fe55ca2cf483f83f524e2606ff086
msgid ""
"If values remain at zero, verify serial wiring, baud rate, and power supply."
msgstr "如果数值始终为零，请检查串口接线、波特率和供电。"
